<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">A useful record helps you remember decisions, explain the sequence to a bank or provider and avoid repeating the same actions. It does not prove what happened, establish forensic findings or guarantee an outcome. Complete urgent money and account actions first.</p>{% call note("care", "Take care", "record after urgent action") %}<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">If money or payment details may be involved, contact the bank or card provider immediately through official details you find independently. Do not wait for an appointment while preparing notes.</p>{% endcall %}
